    { "dot": "cyan", "title": "A typo must not pass", "items": ["An unknown key in the golden set is a hard error, never a warning", "Write 'forbiden_numbers' and the check that catches the split-table bug just stops running", "The report stays green and the published metric quietly becomes a lie"] },
